# Ruling: if a spell targeting a creature with ward is on the stack, Nowhere to Run leaving the battlefield does not make the
# ward trigger - a ward ability triggers when the creature becomes a target (CR 702.21a, 603.2), and it did not then. Bot1's
# Nowhere to Run kills Bot2's Ornithopter on turn three; Bot1 aims Lightning Bolt at Bot2's Sedgemoor Witch (Ward - Pay 3 life);
# Bot2 Disenchants the Nowhere to Run in response. The Bolt resolves, the Witch dies, and Bot1 is never asked to pay 3 life.

[Bot1 Deck]
Swamp
Mox Jet
Mox Ruby
Nowhere to Run
Lightning Bolt
Island x14

[Bot2 Deck]
Forest
Mox Jet
Mox Emerald
Mox Pearl
Mox Ruby
Sedgemoor Witch
Ornithopter
Disenchant
Island x12

